What are you?

97
00:04:52.118 --> 00:04:54.184
Father Time?
Give the kid a Squirt.

98
00:04:54.186 --> 00:04:56.286
I'd like a Jack and Coke.
All right?

99
00:04:56.288 --> 00:04:58.789
