115
00:05:36.796 --> 00:05:38.929
I thought I told you
to stay at the bar.

116
00:05:38.931 --> 00:05:40.297
This your kid, Sam?

117
00:05:40.299 --> 00:05:44.201
Travis, meet Happy.
Happy, meet Travis.

118
00:05:44.203 --> 00:05:45.202
Careful, Travis.

119
00:05:45.204 --> 00:05:49.973
