175
00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.017
You deserve this.

176
00:08:47.019 --> 00:08:49.152
[distant crowd cheering]

177
00:08:49.154 --> 00:08:50.254
I love you, brother.

178
00:08:50.256 --> 00:08:51.423
I love you, too.

179
00:08:52.925 --> 00:08:54.226
