It's the big one.

189
00:09:08.574 --> 00:09:09.973
[chuckles]

190
00:09:09.975 --> 00:09:11.341
[laughs]

191
00:09:11.343 --> 00:09:13.043
You got this.

192
00:09:13.045 --> 00:09:15.545
- We got this.
- Just stay focused.

193
00:09:15.547 --> 00:09:17.916
