284
00:13:23.796 --> 00:13:25.195
Hey, don't worry about it.

285
00:13:25.197 --> 00:13:27.165
No, man, no.
It's not cool.

286
00:13:27.599 --> 00:13:29.266
It's just...

287
00:13:29.268 --> 00:13:30.768
My dad got in trouble again,
and, uh...

288
00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:32.302
