327
00:14:52.384 --> 00:14:54.484
It's good.
It's a big firm, but...

328
00:14:54.486 --> 00:14:55.518
It's good, man.
Real good.

329
00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.821
Dennis, hey, how are you?

330
00:14:56.823 --> 00:14:58.923
