425
00:18:39.078 --> 00:18:40.811
Pogs?

426
00:18:40.813 --> 00:18:41.981
What's that?

427
00:18:45.051 --> 00:18:47.652
Just some game I
used to play as a kid.

428
00:18:49.755 --> 00:18:53.157
Anyway, I better get back
to the party.

429
00:18:53.159 --> 00:18:55.658
And you better
get to sleep,

430
00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.495
