472
00:21:01.153 --> 00:21:03.756
[crying]

473
00:21:13.265 --> 00:21:15.165
My baby! No, no!

474
00:21:15.167 --> 00:21:17.034
Oh, God.

475
00:21:17.036 --> 00:21:20.004
Ashley, for real.
Open your eyes? Huh?

476
00:21:20.006 --> 00:21:22.039
Open your eyes, baby!

477
00:21:22.041 --> 00:21:23.976
What did you do?!

478
00:21:26.779 --> 00:21:28.180
